# A rectangle lathed about its lower edge into a cylinder, a
# sketch in a workplane through a corner of the rectangle, which holds
# the axis, and a small rectangle in it wrapped onto the cylinder picked
# with the mouse, the lathe's construction circles hidden while the
# rectangle is drawn, so that its corners take no point on a circle, and
# the faces made selectable while sketching; the same as path_wrap.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalenceWrap).
key r
move 250 200
down L 250 200
up L 250 200
move 350 250
down L 350 250
up L 350 250
key esc
move 300 250
down L 300 250
up L 300 250
key l shift
key esc
move 250 200
down L 250 200
up L 250 200
key w shift
view default
menu View|Show|Construction Entities
key r
move 275 215
down L 275 215
up L 275 215
move 295 235
down L 295 235
up L 295 235
key esc
menu View|Show|Construction Entities
menu View|Show|Selectable Faces
move 330 280
down L 330 280
up L 330 280
menu Features|Wrap Sketch Onto Face
